From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] jscript: a value asked for as a value or a call is read when it is no function (9621)

An external caller asking for a member with DISPATCH_METHOD|DISPATCH_PROPERTYGET
and no arguments -- how VBScript reads x = jsVar and Set o = jsObj -- got
"function expected" when the member was a variable, an array or an object:
JScript always called it. A property that is no function is now read, as
Windows' JScript does; functions are still called. A Windows Script File's
VBScript block reads its JScript blocks' variables this way (9620), and so
does VBScript reading a JScript page's globals.
---
--- a/dlls/jscript/dispex.c
+++ b/dlls/jscript/dispex.c
@@ -2157,6 +2157,26 @@
     if(pspCaller)
         IServiceProvider_AddRef(pspCaller);
 
+    /* A caller that may mean the value or a call (VBScript reads x = jsVar and Set o = jsObj with
+     * DISPATCH_METHOD|DISPATCH_PROPERTYGET and no arguments): a property that is no function is
+     * read, as Windows' JScript does -- a Windows Script File's VBScript reads its JScript
+     * blocks' variables (wine-sg 9621). */
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_JS_METHODGET_CALLS
+    if(wFlags == (DISPATCH_METHOD|DISPATCH_PROPERTYGET) && prop && pdp && !pdp->cArgs && pvarRes) {
+        dispex_prop_t *p = prop;
+        jsdisp_t *owner = This, *obj;
+
+        while(p->type == PROP_PROTREF && owner->prototype) {
+            p = owner->prototype->props + p->u.ref;
+            owner = owner->prototype;
+        }
+        if(p->type == PROP_BUILTIN || p->type == PROP_ACCESSOR ||
+           (p->type == PROP_JSVAL && (!is_object_instance(p->u.val) ||
+            !(obj = to_jsdisp(get_object(p->u.val))) || !is_class(obj, JSCLASS_FUNCTION))))
+            wFlags = DISPATCH_PROPERTYGET;
+    }
+#endif
+
     switch(wFlags) {
     case DISPATCH_METHOD|DISPATCH_PROPERTYGET:
         wFlags = DISPATCH_METHOD;
